        "3. Add the temporary Runenwerk/render capability, prepared-data, and render-resource adapters with explicit deletion phase comments and no public compatibility re-exports.",
        "4. Replace RenderBackendCapabilityProfile and inspection authority with normalized requirements/facts consumed through the temporary adapter; retain render policy above it.",
        "5. Split RenderResourceDescriptor into generic GpuResourceDescriptor values and render-owned target/history/surface intents; replace combined lifetime/import variants with independent dimensions.",
        "6. Replace render-owned generic resource handles with RunenGPU kind-typed handles while preserving readable current facade methods only as lowering conveniences.",
        "7. Remove GpuParams/TypeId size authority from new GPU descriptors. Current GpuParams values cross only through the temporary prepared-data adapter.",
        "8. Migrate direct graph, primitive, procedural, runtime, application, example, benchmark, and test consumers atomically enough that no duplicate declaration authority remains at any commit intended for merge.",
        "9. Delete old capability profile/default/inspection types, old combined lifetime/import authority, generic RenderResourceDescriptor variants replaced by GpuResourceDescriptor, and replaced render-owned handle authority.",
